    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>negatively charged sol</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>xH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>macromolecular colloid</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CdS</mi></math> sol</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>positively charged sol</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Starch</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>Cheese</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>a gel</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
